+Description: ln: follow a symlinked parent when replacing a link
+ Open the destination's parent directory without O_NOFOLLOW in
+ replace_link; that flag made the open fail with ENOTDIR when the
+ parent's last component is a symlink to a directory, which the initial
+ link creation attempt already follows.
+
+Author: costajohnt
+Origin: other, https://github.com/uutils/coreutils/pull/14851
